OL,3,GNEWSARacist pair jailed for Glasgow
OL,4,Acity 'rampage' attacks on strangers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who carried out a series of
OL,7,Fviolent attacks, including racially
OL,8,Faggravated assaults on a group of
OL,9,FChinese students in Glasgow city centre
OL,10,Fhave been jailed.
OL,12,FLiam Murphy, 19, was sentenced to nine
OL,13,Fyears in prison, while Bradley Lawrie,
OL,14,F20, was ordered to serve
OL,15,Fseven-and-a-half years.
OL,17,FMurphy pled guilty to nine mostly
OL,18,Faggravated assault charges and Lawrie
OL,19,Fto a total of seven offences which were
OL,20,Fcommitted over one night in Glasgow on
OL,21,F14 September last year.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
