OL,3,GNEWSARacist pair jailed for Glasgow
OL,4,Acity 'rampage' attacks on strangers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing them at the High Court in
OL,7,FGlasgow, Lord Cubie described the
OL,8,Fattacks as a "rampage" and the worst
OL,9,Fcase of sustained city centre violence
OL,10,Fhe had encountered in more than 15
OL,11,Fyears.
